{"1298480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kardboard Kings: Card Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 1298480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1888790], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p>💸 <strong>Buy, Sell, or Flex -</strong> Buy low, sell high, or just add Cards to your showcase for all to see!<br><br>🎴 <strong>Collect Over 100 Unique Cards -</strong> From ripping open booster packs, to buying singles, you’ll uncover dozens of vibey Cards featuring illustrations from stacks of talented artists! (Plus their rare, shiny variants!)<br><br>📈 <strong>Master An Ever-Changing Market -</strong> Reprints, rumours, rule changes, kids' meal promos, thieves, and church condemnations (the usual suspects) will all affect the price of your treasured cards. Think fast!<br><br>❤️ <strong>Win the Hearts of Customers -</strong> Befriend regulars by tracking down their requests, help build their decks, and become a part of a sleepy seaside town! Or just rip them off and feel their wrath!<br><br>🏬 <strong>Build The Perfect Shop -</strong> New management means new branding - create your dream shop with a catalogue of walls, flooring, furniture, and knickknacks; everyone loves a good chia pet, right?<br><br>🔍 <strong>Solve The Mystery -</strong> All is not what it seems on the seaside! The appearance of a mysterious masked thief leaves locals wondering who to trust with their precious Cards! Who is this shadowy character? And just what are the Legendary Cards?<br>🌴 <strong>Card Game Island - </strong> Buy a ticket to card game island, testing your wits and wiles against the most formidable duelists in a roguelite deckbuilding game mode.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5b8fb6f017bc3af61ba247fb5abbefc5.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5b8fb6f017bc3af61ba247fb5abbefc5.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5b8fb6f017bc3af61ba247fb5abbefc5.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own Card shop by the seaside! Buy, trade and sell Cards, OR keep them for your own collection! Earn reputation with customers, beat your shop goals, unlock new decorations, and host exciting events to bring everyone to the best Card shop in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5862f76fc72e40b31534b41013eb03a8.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5862f76fc72e40b31534b41013eb03a8.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5862f76fc72e40b31534b41013eb03a8.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Harry Hsu, a young man who recently inherited his father's seaside card shop. Left with just a bit of cash and a tiny inventory, it's up to you to restore the shop's reputation as the center for the most popular trading card game in the world: &quot;Warlock.&quot; With the shop’s reputation on the line, you start working behind the counter, juggling the locals' requests while trying to familiarize yourself with the peculiar market of selling Warlock cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/7c385b47c112f42330a52c2ab80e3292.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/7c385b47c112f42330a52c2ab80e3292.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/7c385b47c112f42330a52c2ab80e3292.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guide, Giuseppe, a fast-talking Cockatoo, helps you in your buying and selling journey - picking up a foil Startled Banana on the cheap and turning it around for a power rare performing great at tournaments. Host booster drafts, clearance sales, in-house tournaments, and release parties for new sets in the game, making sure that your customers have every card they need to be the best duelist in town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/2c5503fd35aa45ddcfaf2a53ca6b46c8.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/2c5503fd35aa45ddcfaf2a53ca6b46c8.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/2c5503fd35aa45ddcfaf2a53ca6b46c8.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you want to be the best duelist Warlock has ever seen, you'll get your opportunity when you travel to Card Game Island! A veritable tropical paradise featuring sandy beaches, sunny skies and the best, toughest Warlock duelists out there. Master your deck, find the legendary cards, and you might just have the chance to outplay the very best duelist in the world. Be careful, though. A single loss sends you home, so only the very best duelists will prevail!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5b8fb6f017bc3af61ba247fb5abbefc5.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5b8fb6f017bc3af61ba247fb5abbefc5.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5b8fb6f017bc3af61ba247fb5abbefc5.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own Card shop by the seaside! Buy, trade and sell Cards, OR keep them for your own collection! Earn reputation with customers, beat your shop goals, unlock new decorations, and host exciting events to bring everyone to the best Card shop in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5862f76fc72e40b31534b41013eb03a8.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5862f76fc72e40b31534b41013eb03a8.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/5862f76fc72e40b31534b41013eb03a8.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Harry Hsu, a young man who recently inherited his father's seaside card shop. Left with just a bit of cash and a tiny inventory, it's up to you to restore the shop's reputation as the center for the most popular trading card game in the world: &quot;Warlock.&quot; With the shop’s reputation on the line, you start working behind the counter, juggling the locals' requests while trying to familiarize yourself with the peculiar market of selling Warlock cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/7c385b47c112f42330a52c2ab80e3292.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/7c385b47c112f42330a52c2ab80e3292.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/7c385b47c112f42330a52c2ab80e3292.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guide, Giuseppe, a fast-talking Cockatoo, helps you in your buying and selling journey - picking up a foil Startled Banana on the cheap and turning it around for a power rare performing great at tournaments. Host booster drafts, clearance sales, in-house tournaments, and release parties for new sets in the game, making sure that your customers have every card they need to be the best duelist in town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/2c5503fd35aa45ddcfaf2a53ca6b46c8.poster.avif?t=1786047010\" width=780 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/2c5503fd35aa45ddcfaf2a53ca6b46c8.webm?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/extras/2c5503fd35aa45ddcfaf2a53ca6b46c8.mp4?t=1786047010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you want to be the best duelist Warlock has ever seen, you'll get your opportunity when you travel to Card Game Island! A veritable tropical paradise featuring sandy beaches, sunny skies and the best, toughest Warlock duelists out there. Master your deck, find the legendary cards, and you might just have the chance to outplay the very best duelist in the world. Be careful, though. A single loss sends you home, so only the very best duelists will prevail!</p>", "short_description": "Open your own Card shop by the seaside! Buy, trade and sell Cards, OR keep them for your own collection! Earn reputation with customers, beat your shop goals, unlock new decorations, and host exciting events to bring everyone to the best Card shop in town!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/header.jpg?t=1786047010", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786047010", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786047010", "website": "https://www.henryshouse.com.au/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3rd Gen i3/AMD FX-4100 Series<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7 Series/Radeon R7 Series<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 5th Gen i3/1st Gen Ryzen (or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 